### Chat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain microservices in simple terms"
}


### Streaming (SSE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Write a short poem"
}


### Voice chat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/voice-chat
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="recording.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./recording.wav
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="conversationId"

optional-id
------WebKitFormBoundary--
